source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The rule is per whitespace-separated token, so Jira breaks in both and jiro reads two hard breaks.
-- input.jira --
x\\y z\\w
-- rendered.html --
<p>x<br class="atl-forced-newline" />y z<br class="atl-forced-newline" />w</p>
-- want.md --
x\
y z\
w
-- warnings.json --
[]
